) loop of the TCR is more critical than other CDR loops in the interaction with the peptide and in determining the specificity of the TCR-pMHC binding
3
(Fig
1
c). Its length and amino acid sequence are highly variable, which reflects the high diversity of T cell receptors selected in the thymus
4
.
